aps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"role":"collection","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/accessibilityCustomContent(_:_:importance:)-n5nc":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"title":"accessibilityCustomContent(_:_:importance:)","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/accessibilitycustomcontent(_:_:importance:)-n5nc","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/accessibilityCustomContent(_:_:importance:)-n5nc","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"accessibilityCustomContent"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI29AccessibilityCustomContentKeyV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AccessibilityCustomContentKey"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI18LocalizedStringKeyV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"LocalizedStringKey"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"importance"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)AXCustomContent","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AXCustomContent"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@E@AXCustomContentImportance","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Importance"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI15ModifiedContentV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ModifiedContent"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"